    ],
    "independent_extent": "Ten indexed20-byte records in PS2 and ten unrolled equivalent loads in both Golden architectures. All200 live bytes of every source preset have one exact NSO match. Extra8 PS2 bytes are zero outside ten-record extent, not source data to stitch into a next bank.",
